(II) If $\tan \alpha = 3$, find the value of $f(\alpha)$.

In $\triangle ABC$, the sides opposite to angles $A$, $B$, and $C$ are $a$, $b$, and $c$ respectively. Given that $\sin C + \sin(B - A) = \sqrt{2} \sin 2A$, and $A \neq \frac{\pi}{2}$.
