3x + y \geq 3 \\
x \leq 4 \\
y \geq 0
\end{cases}
$$
Determine the number of units in the length of the longest side of the polygonal region formed by this system. Express your answer in simplest radical form.

For some constants \( c \) and \( d \), let \[ g(x) = \left\{
\begin{array}{cl}
cx + d & \text{if } x < 3, \\
10 - 2x & \text{if } x \ge 3.
\end{array}
\right.\] The function \( g \) has the property that \( g(g(x)) = x \) for all \( x \). What is \( c + d \)?

In $\triangle ABC$, the sides opposite to angles $A$, $B$, and $C$ are respectively $a$, $b$, and $c$. It is given that $\frac{-b + \sqrt{2}c}{\cos B} = \frac{a}{\cos A}$,  
$(I)$ Find the size of angle $A$;  
$(II)$ If $a=2$, find the maximum value of the area $S$.

