(Ⅱ) Given point $M\left( \dfrac{1}{2},0 \right)$, line $l$ intersects circle $C$ at points $A$ and $B$. Find the value of $\left| \left| MA \right|-\left| MB \right| \right|$.

Given the system of equations
\begin{align*}
4x+2y &= c, \\
